{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "01KH", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:79cc972e1883926566e998fe9e9a74573586fced33101fbd36c7c31db320e500", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nOn the other hand, the following example shows that we cannot\nexpect the image of an affine to be contained in an affine.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:204fa1b16e6b44c7ef1d81d17ec5aac5b5bdf12dfb45dcb1e0f1e58d41e942be", "unit_id": "tag:01KH:prose-0004"}
